  "id": "myosin",
  "term": "myosin",
  "definition": "Myosin, here referring to Myosin-3, is a muscle-related protein involved in muscle development and regeneration. In the source material, changes in the MYH3 gene are described as potentially disrupting energy-dependent myosin activity and impairing muscle regeneration, which may worsen Duchenne muscular dystrophy.",
